PATH RESOLUTION NOTE (no silent drift)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated prompt's "Output" path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Charging/**` is NOT a
compiled source root in this repository. project.yml compiles `apps/apple/Sources/**` (plus
the TeslaSync/{feature-views,dashboard-widgets,misc-surfaces,shared-surfaces,widget-primitives}
parity-artifact roots), and every sibling P7 page — Powershare, TrueCost, SleepEfficiency,
BatteryDegradation, FleetCompare — lives under `apps/apple/Sources/Features/<Domain>/**`.
The page was implemented there so it actually compiles into the iOS + macOS app targets
(verified: all 12 CostAnalysis*.swift appear as SwiftCompile units in BOTH the macOS and iOS
builds). `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Charging/` would have produced dead, uncompiled code.
Faithful interpretation of the artifact's intent ("the Charging feature directory"), not scope
narrowing.

